---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="About Garrett Potts | Potts Plumbing"
  description="Meet Garrett Potts and learn about Potts Plumbing, a local home plumbing business in North Georgia."
  currentPage="about"
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="interior-hero">
      <div class="container interior-hero__grid">
        <p class="eyebrow">About / Potts Plumbing</p>
        <div>
          <h1>A local plumbing business, rooted in North Georgia.</h1>
          <p>Potts Plumbing is the home plumbing business Garrett Potts started to serve homeowners across North Georgia.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-story section-rule">
      <div class="container about-story__grid">
        <p class="eyebrow">A local point of view</p>
        <div>
          <h2>One home, one clear conversation at a time.</h2>
          <p>The work ranges from everyday repairs and fixture changes to water heaters, drains, pipes, and the less-obvious plumbing jobs around a home. You do not need to diagnose an issue first; Garrett can help clarify the project and talk through practical options.</p>
          <p>He explains the proposed work and pricing before it begins, so you know what to expect and can choose how to move forward.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-principles section-tint">
      <div class="container about-principles__grid">
        <div class="about-principles__intro">
          <p class="eyebrow">What matters in the work</p>
          <h2>Clear expectations. Care in the details.</h2>
          <p>Transparent pricing and best-in-class service are part of the standard Potts Plumbing aims to bring to home plumbing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-principles__steps">
          <article><span>01</span><div><h3>Start with a simple note</h3><p>A few words about what you have noticed or want to change is enough to begin. No diagnosis needed.</p></div></article>
          <article><span>02</span><div><h3>Get clear options and pricing</h3><p>Garrett explains the proposed work and price before you decide how to proceed.</p></div></article>
          <article><span>03</span><div><h3>Choose a practical next step</h3><p>Garrett helps you understand the options so you can choose what works for your home.</p></div></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-contact section-rule">
      <div class="container about-contact__inner">
        <p class="eyebrow">North Georgia home plumbing</p>
        <div>
          <h2>Have a project to talk through?</h2>
          <p>Start with an email or reach Garrett by phone.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-contact__actions">
          <a class="button-dark" href="mailto:gtpservices212@gmail.com">Email Garrett</a>
          <a href="tel:+17706853901">(770) 685-3901</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
